1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,420
You can work with several trades at once. Click one to select it.

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,020
Hold Ctrl and click another to add it.

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:13,610
Shift and click selects every trade in between.

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:18,970
Now the menu acts on all of them, for example Close 2 Positions.

5
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:22,230
Press Escape to go back to a single trade.

6
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:27,190
With a trade clicked, Ctrl+A selects every trade in the table.

7
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:30,450
The keyboard works too. Use Up and Down to move between trades.

8
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:34,760
Alt+C opens Close Position for the selected trade. We will cancel it here.

9
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:38,760
Alt+T sets a stop loss, Alt+L a take profit, and Alt+H opens a hedge.

10
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:42,760
Careful: Delete and Ctrl+C also close the selected trade here.

